{"unit_id":"lxchapu__dsh-session-purge#card-zh","repo":"lxchapu/dsh-session-purge","commit":"5cddebf3bcceac4b0cb9b5ac8b6f2df135286f25","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"@lxchapu/dsh-session-purge 是面向 DSH Web 侧边栏的会话永久删除插件。它由宿主路由与客户端插槽协作：可从每条会话的菜单删除单条会话，也可在仅显示归档会话时批量删除归档集合。操作前提供二次确认，正在运行的会话会被拒绝；删除后清理工作区记录、会话日志及相关存储状态。它适合需要整理 DSH 会话列表和移除旧会话的用户。无需额外 API Key 或外部服务；默认使用 ~/.dsh，也可通过 DSH_HOME 指定主目录。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:570-610","lib/client.js:566-629","lib/index.js:64"]}
{"unit_id":"lxchapu__dsh-session-purge#card-en","repo":"lxchapu/dsh-session-purge","commit":"5cddebf3bcceac4b0cb9b5ac8b6f2df135286f25","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"@lxchapu/dsh-session-purge adds permanent session deletion to the DSH web sidebar. Delete one session from its menu or bulk delete archived sessions. Both require confirmation; running sessions are refused. It clears workspace references and logs. No API key or external service is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:570-610","lib/client.js:566-629","lib/index.js:64"]}
